          "   bahwa kasus itu sudah selesai.",
          "   = The police informed the victim's",
          "     family that the case was closed.",
          "",
          "ber- works the same way, a prefix alone:",
          "",
          "   bertanggung jawab   to be answerable",
          "   bekerja sama        to work together"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Beri tahu. Memberi tahu. Memberitahukan.",
          "2": "Tanda tangan. Menandatangani."
